{"Map-Title":"04: Containment","Map-Author":"Darkademic","Map-Categories-Mission":"Campaign","Map-Briefing":"The Soviets continue to test the limits of chrono technology - but we have caught up to them.\n\nDuring the recent conflicts, the GDI commander we rescued aided us in identifying a critical flaw in their technology. If we can place a device inside the Soviet Chronosphere, we can contain its power.\n\nHowever, our previous attempts to get personnel close enough have been thwarted by Soviet patrols and blockade.\n\nBreak through the Soviet defenses and get your Engineers to the Chronosphere to deploy the containment device."}
